# Frontend Implementation Rules

## Stack
- Vue3 + TypeScript
- Pinia for state
- Vue Router for routing
- Element Plus for admin

## Structure
- portal and admin are separated projects
- API requests must be encapsulated under `/api`
- route guards should handle auth and admin role check
- forms must have validation

## UI priority
- Functionality first
- Keep pages clean and maintainable
- Avoid over-designed UI in early phase
